# Chargestone Cave and Mistralton Cave (stones that hum with charge, sparks underfoot): a sparse celesta figure in E minor over
# a held choir pad, a low synth pulse and a dry beat, one bar of B major in the middle to make the air crackle. The cave plays
# the same by day and by night, as the original's caves do. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U7, part a).
